# Project map

Полная карта: `docs/Meta/Structure.md`. Narrative: `docs/Home.md`.

## Корень

`compose.yaml`, `sail.cmd`, `.env.example` — Sail (PHP 8.4, pgvector, Redis, Mailpit, Ollama). Artisan: `docker compose exec laravel.test php artisan …`

## HTTP

Только `routes/api.php` + `bootstrap/app.php` (alias middleware `storyteller`). Без `web.php`, Blade, Inertia.

## Backend (`app/`)

| Путь | Назначение |
|------|------------|
| `Http/Controllers/` | Chat, Copilot, RagSearch, Auth, GameSession, Scene, SceneContext, SceneParticipant, CharacterSheet |
| `Http/Middleware/EnsureStoryteller.php` | ST-only routes |
| `Rag/` | RagIndexer facade, MessageIndexer, MessageSearcher, EmbeddingProvider, TextChunker |
| `Llm/` | OllamaChatProvider, NpcCopilotService |
| `Context/` | ContextAssembler + providers, ContextBuilder facade, TokenEstimator |
| `Scene/` | SceneContextService, SceneParticipantService |
| `Retrieval/` | scoped tools: search_messages, get_message_range; scope = chronicle + session; HybridRetrievalCoordinator; CteGuard; GraphRAG в assembler, не в tool-loop |
| `World/` | WorldEntityService, AliasNormalizer; typed characters/locations/factions/items/concepts/events; WorldRelationTypeCatalog, WorldRelationTypeValidator, WorldRelationService, WorldEventService, WorldGraphRag |
| `Lore/` | LoreEntryService, LoreIndexer, LoreSearcher |
| `Rulebook/` | RulesetService, RuleDocumentService, RuleIndexer, RuleSearcher |
| `Memory/` | CharacterMemoryService, CharacterMemorySearcher, MemoryBridgeService, MemoryGraphRag |
| `Character/` | CharacterStatService, CharacterSheetReader, SheetCatalog, CharacterAccess, CharacterIdentityService, CharacterHealthService, CharacterMeritService, DisciplineService, CharacterStatusService, CharacterBiographyService, CharacterBioIndexer, CharacterBioSearcher, CharacterRelationshipService, CharacterAffiliationService, CharacterLoreKnowledgeService, CharacterRuleKnowledgeService |
| `Jobs/` | IndexRagMessageJob |
| `Enums/` | `RetrievalCorpus`; `MemoryEntityRole`; `ChronicleStatus`, `GameSessionStatus`, `SceneStatus`, `SceneParticipantRole`; `WorldEntityType`, `WorldEntityStatus`, `WorldEntityAliasType`; Location/Faction/Item/Concept/`CharacterType` (`player`/`npc`/`ghoul`), `CharacterStatCategory`, `CharacterHealthState`, `CharacterHealthDamage`, `CharacterMeritKind`, `CharacterStatusEffectType`, `CharacterBiographyStatus`, `CharacterBiographySection`, `CharacterAffiliationType`, `CharacterAffiliationStance`, `WorldEventType`, `WorldEventStatus`, `WorldEventVisibility`, `WorldEventParticipantRole`; Lore/Ruleset/Knowledge/Memory enums |

Конфиг: `config/rag.php`, `config/ollama.php`, `config/copilot.php`, `config/retrieval.php`, `config/character_sheet.php`.

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

`src/views/` (ChatView, CharacterListView, CharacterSheetView), `src/auth.js`, `src/router.js`, `styles.css`. Vite на хосте: `cd frontend && npm run dev`.

## Database

Канон схемы: `docs/Architecture/Database.md`. Миграции и factories в `database/`. Тестовая DB: `testing`. Не перечислять таблицы в чате — читать заметку. Живые строки — SQL/tinker, не дамп в ответ.

## Тесты

`tests/Feature/`: Authentication, Chat, Character, CharacterSheet, CharacterStat, CharacterDiscipline, CharacterStatus, CharacterBiography, CharacterBioIndex, CharacterRelationship, CharacterAffiliation, WorldEvent, LoreEntry, LoreIndex, RuleDocument, RuleIndex, CharacterKnowledge, CharacterMemoryNode, CharacterMemoryEdge, MemoryBridge, RetrievalCorpus, HybridRetrieval, MemoryGraphRag, WorldGraphRag, WorldRelationType, WorldRelation, ChronicleIsolation, GameSessionScene, SceneContext, SceneParticipant, WorldEntity, TypedWorldEntity, RagSearch, Copilot, ContextAssembler, RetrievalTools, RetrievalGuardrail. `UserFactory::storyteller()`, password `password`. Ollama: `Http::fake`/`ChatProvider` fake. RAG: `stub` в `phpunit.xml`.

## Out of scope

Таблицы `character_users` / `npcs` как отдельный legacy-слой, `world/` UI, редакторы лора/памяти/биографии в SPA, Copilot для гулей, streaming, `laravel/ai`. Цели персонажа сняты. Внутриигровое время (этап 17) снято. См. `docs/Project/Roadmap.md`.

При изменении структуры каталогов — обновить `docs/Meta/Structure.md`.
